{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は別のお仕事と重なってしまって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしても上手く調整出来ず、握手会に参加出来ませんでした(；д；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてくださってた皆さんごめんなさい(；д；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、また次の握手会とか、クリスマスライブも沢山あるからね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアー握手会開催しますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/11/24/2340678/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/11/24/2340678/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近く"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/11/24/2340678/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/11/24/2340678/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっおてて〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/11/24/2340678/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゅっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/11/24/2340678/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/11/24/2340678/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫もいるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返しは次やります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}